---
description: Tests for agent workflows (RubyLLM::Test, Langfuse integration)
globs:
  - "test/agents/**/*_test.rb"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Testing agents

- Framework: Minitest. Descriptions in English.
- Stub LLM calls with `RubyLLM::Test` — do not hit provider APIs in unit tests.
- Langfuse connectivity tests may call the Langfuse API when credentials are present; skip otherwise (`skip` unless `ENV['LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY']`).
- Prefer testing agent logic with stubbed responses; reserve live Langfuse fetches for stable fixture prompts (e.g. `test/rails-test-prompt`).
- Follow RubyLLM and Langfuse documentation for testing patterns as agents are implemented.
